// 正确结果：最后一根柱附近四个矩形，Extend.None 不延伸，Left/Right/Both 分别向对应方向延伸
indicator("Chart Test: graph/box/extend", overlay: true, max_boxes_count: 10);

if bar_state.is_last {
    let top = close * 1.015;
    let bot = close * 0.985;
    let step = 6;
    Box.new(bar_index - 4 * step, top, bar_index - 3 * step, bot,
        bg_color: Color.new(Color.BLUE, 80),   border_color: Color.BLUE,   extend: Extend.None);
    Box.new(bar_index - 2 * step, top, bar_index - 1 * step, bot,
        bg_color: Color.new(Color.RED, 80),    border_color: Color.RED,    extend: Extend.Left);
    Box.new(bar_index,            top, bar_index + step,      bot,
        bg_color: Color.new(Color.GREEN, 80),  border_color: Color.GREEN,  extend: Extend.Right);
    Box.new(bar_index + 2 * step, top, bar_index + 3 * step,  bot,
        bg_color: Color.new(Color.ORANGE, 80), border_color: Color.ORANGE, extend: Extend.Both);
}
